<title>USA: IMF posts SDR rates on Internet.</title>
<headline>IMF posts SDR rates on Internet.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The International Monetary Fund said on Thursday it has begun posting Special Drawing Rights rates for selected countries on the Internet.</p>
<p>The rates are updated at approximately 1 p.m. ET (1800 GMT) and 4 p.m. ET (2100 GMT) each working day at address www.imf.org/external/np/tre/sdr/sdr.htm, the IMF said.</p>
<p>((-- Washington Newsroom (202) 898-8300))</p>
</text>
